          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On December 9, 1976, a couple out for a walk noticed a stationary, bright white light in the sky. They were very surprised by the variations in light intensity, followed by its rapid and silent movement towards the southeast. No other witnesses were found for this phenomenon, for which we have limited information.",
